    "updateTime": "2026-11-23T22:05:00+08:00",
    "generalSituationZh": "一道冷鋒會在明早橫過廣東沿岸，並為該區帶來有雨的天氣，受冷鋒隨後的東北季候風影響，明日廣東天氣逐步轉涼，隨後一兩日該區早晚清涼。隨著東北季候風緩和及覆蓋廣東的雲帶轉薄，本週後期該區天色逐漸好轉，氣溫回升。預料一股較乾燥的東北季候風補充會在週末期間影響華南沿岸，該區日夜溫差頗大。",
    "generalSituationEn": "A cold front will move across the coast of Guangdong tomorrow morning and bring rainy weather to the region. Under the influence of the northeast monsoon associated with the cold front, it will become cooler progressively over Guangdong tomorrow. It will be cool in the morning and at night in the following couple of days over the region. With the northeast monsoon moderating and the band of clouds covering Guangdong thinning out, the weather will improve gradually and temperatures will rise over the region in the latter part of this week. A relatively dry replenishment of the northeast monsoon is expected to affect the coast of southern China over the weekend. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large over the region.",
